# =============================================================================
# .gitignore - ASL CORE KERNEL & AVIONICS RESEARCH ENVIRONMENT
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. TEMPAT ANALISIS & KARANTINA BINARY (Analysis Staging Area)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Folder Analysis adalah pos isolasi file eksternal (.dll, .exe, .deb, firmware).
# Semua file binary mentah & unduhan diabaikan agar repositori git tetap ringan
# dan bebas dari binary/malware/dump liar.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Analysis/quarantine_incoming/*
!Analysis/quarantine_incoming/.gitkeep
!Analysis/quarantine_incoming/README.md

Analysis/binaries_pe_dll_exe/*
!Analysis/binaries_pe_dll_exe/.gitkeep
!Analysis/binaries_pe_dll_exe/README.md

Analysis/packages_deb_pkg/*
!Analysis/packages_deb_pkg/.gitkeep
!Analysis/packages_deb_pkg/README.md

Analysis/firmware_rom_bin/*
!Analysis/firmware_rom_bin/.gitkeep
!Analysis/firmware_rom_bin/README.md

# Laporan analisis (reports) tetap dicatat di git sebagai bukti ilmiah,
# kecuali file dump binary berukuran besar di dalamnya.
Analysis/reports/*.dump
Analysis/reports/*.raw
Analysis/reports/*.bin

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. FILE BINER, EKSEKUSI & ARSIP SISTEM (Universal Binary Exclusions)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.sys
*.drv
*.bin
*.rom
*.hex
*.img
*.iso
*.qcow2
*.vmdk

# Linux & Mac Packages
*.deb
*.rpm
*.pkg
*.dmg
*.apk
*.ipa

# Arsip & Kompresi Besar
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.tar.xz
*.7z
*.rar

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. ARTEFAK KOMPILASI (Rust, C/C++, LLVM, GCC)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rust / Cargo
target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.backup

# C / C++ / Assembly / Object files
*.o
*.obj
*.ko
*.elf
*.a
*.lib
*.out
*.asm.out

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. PYTHON, TOOLS CACHE & LOGS
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
*.log

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. TEMPORARY & SYSTEM OS CLUTTER
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Temporary Files
*.tmp
*.temp
*~
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo

# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. IDE & EDITOR SETTINGS
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
.idea/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. CRASH DUMPS & CORE PROFILES
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.dmp
*.core
core
vgcore.*

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 8. LOCAL-ONLY GOVERNANCE, TOOLS & BOARD ARCHITECTURE DOCUMENTS
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only governance files
/AGENT.md
/GEMINI.md

# Local-only board architecture documents (covering exact and plural variations)
/120_board_architectures.md
**/120_board_architectures.md
/120_board_architecture.md
**/120_board_architecture.md

# Local-only project tools
/tools/
**/tools/

# Test runs and logs
/logs/
**/logs/
/Python/
**/Python/

